  "title": "Newly FDA-Approved REVTORPYK™ (gedatolisib) Included in the National Comprehensive Cancer Network® (NCCN®) Clinical Practice Guidelines for HR+/HER2- Locally Advanced or Metastatic Breast Cancer",
